{"id":"5586","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5586_main_extensive-line-of-cumulus-congestus-cumulonimbus-calvus-and-capillatus-incus-praecipitatio_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>图为<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">秃积雨云</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">浓积云</span>的侧翼阶梯云，后边是一行<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">成熟的砧状鬃积雨云</span>单体。<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">远处的降水</span>正从后一行落下。</p>\n<p>图片的前景是破碎的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">碎积云</span>，以及部分积雨云扩散形成的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">层积云</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">高积云</span>。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Rodney Hale","location":"英国，中央贝德福郡MK45，贝德福德，霍顿康奎斯特","latitude":"纬度: 52° 4' 5'' N","longitude":"经度: 0° 28' 17'' W","date":"25 August 2012 1436 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西北","cloudCode":"CL= 9, CM= 6, CH= 0","code":"图像P/S代码: S.10.3","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.10.3"},{"src":"/images/original/syn/5586_syn_extensive-line-of-cumulus-congestus-cumulonimbus-calvus-and-capillatus-incus-praecipitatio_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>低气压系统东移跨过英国威尔士和英格兰中部地区时产生的不稳定条件</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 皇家版权","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/original/upper/5586_upper_extensive-line-of-cumulus-congestus-cumulonimbus-calvus-and-capillatus-incus-praecipitatio_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>从地表到位于268 hPa对流层顶的条件不稳定和高水汽含量</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 怀俄明大学","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/sat/5586_sat_extensive-line-of-cumulus-congestus-cumulonimbus-calvus-and-capillatus-incus-praecipitatio_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>英国英格兰南部和中部上空的积雨云单体</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© EUMETSAT, 2012","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4752_main_cumulonimbus-capillatus-incus-praecipitatio_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc5\"><p>该图显示了积雨云上升云塔的大型垂直范围。顶部被傍晚的太阳照亮，左侧呈现明亮的白色，而云的其余部分则更暗。<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">右上方的云是纤维状的</span>，表明是鬃状云云种，右侧有一个砧状切变 - 这是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">砧状附加特征</span>。云的顶部（从这个角度看）<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">正在失去锐度</span>，因为这个细胞从浓积云转变为积雨云。在云层之下，太阳照亮了一个<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">强大的降水轴</span> - 降水性补充特征。几乎围绕强大对流云的深灰色云层是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">层积云</span>，而左上方的白色纤维云是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">毛卷云</span>。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Frann Brothers","location":"美国德克萨斯州得林瓜","latitude":"纬度: 29° 19' 18'' N","longitude":"经度: 103° 36' 58'' W","date":"21 August 2014 1800 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西北","cloudCode":"CL= 9, CM= 0, CH= 1","code":"图像P/S代码: P.10.3","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.10.3"}]}]}